_A8 = [("Nanawagan sa mga mananampalataya si Manila Archbishop Luis Antonio Cardinal Tagle na mangumpisal ngayong Mahal na Araw at patuloy na suportahan ang kanilang Huwag kang Magnakaw campaign na isang paraan ng pagbabalik-loob sa Panginoon at pagtalima sa mabuting balita.", "Manila Archbishop Luis Antonio Cardinal Tagle called on the faithful to confess this Holy Week and to continue supporting their “Huwag kang Magnakaw” campaign, which is a way of returning to the Lord and obeying the good news."), ("Sa kanyang inilabas na circular, hinimok rin ni Tagle ang lahat na mangumpisal bago ang paglahok sa taunang tradisyon na Visita Iglesia tuwing Huwebes Santo.", "In the circular he released, Tagle also urged everyone to confess before joining the annual tradition of Visita Iglesia every Holy Thursday."), ("Hinikayat rin niya ang mga mananampalataya na magsuot ng Huwag kang Magnakaw t-shirt sa Visita Iglesia bilang simbolo nang pagwawaksi sa lahat ng uri ng kasamaan partikular na ang paglabag sa ika-pitong utos ng Panginoon.", "He also encouraged the faithful to wear a “Huwag kang Magnakaw” t-shirt at the Visita Iglesia as a symbol of renouncing all kinds of evil, particularly the violation of the seventh commandment of the Lord."), ("Ang Huwag kang Magnakaw campaign ay inisyatibo ng Archdiocese of Manila Public Affairs Ministry, Radio Veritas at Adamson University para paghilumin ang buong bansa at maibalik ang kultura ng katapatan.", "The “Huwag kang Magnakaw” campaign is an initiative of the Archdiocese of Manila Public Affairs Ministry, Radio Veritas and Adamson University to heal the whole nation and restore the culture of honesty.")]
_K8 = [("Main idea", "Archbishop Luis Antonio Cardinal Tagle calls on the faithful to support the Huwag kang Magnakaw (Don’t steal) campaign."), ("1", "Through a circular, Tagle asked the people to confess during Holy Week and to continue supporting the Huwag kang Magnakaw program."), ("2", "The campaign is a form of renewal of faith and obedience to the good news."), ("3", "Tagle urged everyone to confess before joining the annual tradition of Visita Iglesia (church visitation) every Holy Thursday."), ("4", "Tagle also encouraged the faithful to wear the Huwag kang Magnakaw t-shirt during the Visita Iglesia."), ("5", "The t-shirt symbolizes the elimination of all kinds of evil, particularly the violation of the seventh commandment of God."), ("6", "The campaign is the initiative of the Archdiocese of Manila Public Affairs Ministry, Radio Veritas and Adamson University for the country’s reconciliation and the return of the culture of honesty.")]
_A9 = [("Speaker One", "Do your best para makamit mo ’yung mga pangarap mo. At saka, ang kahirapan, oo nandiyan ’yan lagi. Ngunit kung mas malaki pa ’yung determinasyon nating makapag-aral, mababalewala ang kahirapan at matatakpan ito ng determinasyon para makamit ang mga pangarap.", "Do your best so that you can achieve your dreams. And also, poverty, yes, it is always there. But if our determination to study is even greater, poverty will be disregarded and will be covered by determination to achieve dreams."), ("Speaker Two", "Ayon, lagi nilang ano tandaan na ano, na gawin nilang ano gawin nilang inspirasyon yung mga ano mga nangyayari sa kanilang buhay kasi ’yun ang magsisilbing lakas nila para makuha ang tagumpay na gusto nilang makamit.", "So, they should always, um, remember to make the, um, things that happen in their lives their inspiration, because that will serve as their strength to get the success they want to achieve."), ("Speaker Three", "Gusto kong sabihin na gamitin nila ’yung chance na ’yun, gamitin nila ’yung pagkakataon na ’yun para patunayan na deserving sila sa tulong na binibigay ng DSWD at deserving sila sa pagpapa-aral ng mga magulang nila. Sa tulong ng gobyerno kaya natin ang pagbabago.", "I want to say that they should use that chance, use that opportunity to prove that they are deserving of the help given by the DSWD and deserving of their parents’ schooling of them. With the help of the government, we can bring about change.")]
_K9 = [["Speaker 1 (002)", "Do your best to achieve your dreams. Poverty will always be there, but if you are determined enough to pursue your studies, poverty will be overshadowed by your determination to reach your dreams."], ["Speaker 2 (003)", "Always remember to make your life experiences your inspiration, because that will be your strength to achieve your goals in life."], ["Speaker 3 (004)", "Take the opportunity to prove that you deserve the assistance you get from the DSWD and from your parents in pursuing your studies. With the help of the government we will succeed."]]
